fcp (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Major release v2.0.0.
  * Added sparse file acceleration (--sparse=auto|always|never).
  * Added archive mode (-a) and metadata/xattr preservation (-p, --preserve).
  * Added atomic replacement mode (--atomic).

